	\subseteq\mathscr{G}\,,\]
and let $\delta\mathscr{U}$ denote the leaf edges of $\mathscr{U}$. Decompose
	\[
	\omega
	\equiv\begin{pmatrix}
	\omega_\textup{in}\\
	\omega_{\delta U}\\
	\omega_\textup{out}
	\end{pmatrix}
	\equiv
	\begin{pmatrix}
	(\omega_{\bm{L},j}
	: \textup{some edge in 
