\label{l:perturb.below.variables} Let $\mathbb{P}={\textup{\textsf{\footnotesize PGW}}}(T)$, where $T\equiv T_{v_\textup{\textsc{rt}}a_\textup{\textsc{rt}}}$ is any fixed variable-to-clause tree of maximum vertex degree at most $\mathfrak{c}$. We allow $T=\varnothing$, in which case $\mathbb{P}={\textup{\textsf{\footnotesize PGW}}}(\varnothing)={\textup{\textsf{\footnotesize PGW}}}$. If $\mathscr{T}\equiv\mathscr{T}_{v_\textup{\textsc{rt}}a_\textup{\textsc{rt}}}$ is sampled from $\mathbb{P}$, then
