	{\textup{\textbf{PGW}}}\Big(\textup{$v_\textup{\textsc{rt}}$ not stable}\Big)
	+P'
	\le \frac{O(1)}{\exp(\Omega(2^{k/12}R))}\,,
	\]
and the claimed bound follows.

