	k^{|V_{T'}|-1} 
	\le (\alpha k^2)^{\ell'\mathfrak{c}}\,.
	\label{e:lebesgue.vol.of.embeddings}
	\end{align}
The law of $\mathscr{T}$ conditioned on any such embedding is equivalent to its law under the measure ${\textup{\textbf{PGW}}}(T')$ described in Definition~\ref{d:PGW.based.on.T}. The expectation 
\eqref{e:expected.number.of.embeddings} is then equal to
