	+ \textup{Bin}\bigg( mk-|E_{T'}|, \frac1n\bigg)\,,\]
where $|\delta_{\zeta'(T')} u|$ is the degree of $u$ in the subgraph $\zeta'(T')$. We then proceed to reveal the edges incident to the neighboring clauses of $u$, and so on until we have explored the entire subgraph
	\[\mathscr{H} \equiv\zeta'(T') \cup B_R(\zeta'(B'))\,. \]
