	\prod_{u\in B'}\bigg\{ \Big[{\textup{\textbf{PGW}}}(T_u) \Big]\bigg(
	\textup{root of $\mathscr{T}'$
	is in $A(\mathscr{T}')$} \bigg)\bigg\}\,,
