Take $I_1$ as in Corollary~\ref{c:intermediate.overlap},
and $I_2$ as in
\eqref{e:separable.near.one.interval}. 
Then,
recalling Definition~\ref{d:separable}
and \eqref{e:def.ZZ},
	\[\bm{Z}_\textup{sep}
