We make the analogous definition in the pair model: given a variable-to-clause message $\dot{q}\equiv\dot{q}_{va}$ (a measure on pairs of colors $(\sigma^1,\sigma^2)\in\set{\SSPIN{r},\SSPIN{y},\SSPIN{g},\SSPIN{b}}^2$), define its reweighted version
