\label{p:pair.clause.weights}
Suppose in the pair model that the clause $a$ receives incoming messages $\dot{q}_e$ ($e\in\delta a$) whose reweighted versions $Q_e$ (defined by \eqref{e:reweighted.messages.v.to.c}) satisfy, for some absolute constant $0<\zeta\le1/20$,
