	=\mathcal{Y}(\SPIN{Y}\SPIN{W})
	+O\Bigg(
		\frac{{}^\textup{m}\hspace{-2pt}\bm{\delta}}{2^k} + \frac{\bm{\dot{\delta}}}{4^k}
