\label{l:rrUnforced} Let $\epsilon_2$ be a small absolute constant. Fix $x\in\set{\SPIN{+},\SPIN{-}}$, and let $v$ be a variable of type $\bm{T}$. Suppose we are given $\omega\in\bm{I}_0$ with marginal $\pi$ such that for both $i=1,2$ we have 
