proving \eqref{enotEnoughReds}. A very similar argument proves \eqref{enotEnoughReds} in the case that \eqref{e:too.many.ry} holds for $\tau=\SSPIN{g}$ instead of $\tau=\SSPIN{y}$. As explained above, 
\eqref{enotEnoughReds} implies the lemma, so this concludes the proof.
